25,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have plenty of coders, but the phenotyping experts have vanished. However, the glasshouse crew is strong.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Computing is free now, which is great! But shipping costs are up, even if the glasshouse subsidy is still there.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Catalogues seem to have a lasting impact. Mechanism studies often end without answers. Also, breeding colonies cause the most delays.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Field sites are a disaster—floods and fires! And the spectroscopy suite was down for eleven weeks. It's a mess.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The animal facility is finally stable with vet cover, but the glasshouses are completely full for two cycles.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if the glasshouses are full, does that make the strong crew there irrelevant for new projects?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, if the spectroscopy tools are broken, we should avoid projects that rely on them, right?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree with Sakura. And we should be careful with projects involving live breeding.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Takumi,,Exactly. Anything relying on field sites or that specific equipment is a huge risk right now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, the crew is there, but the space is not. We cannot fund something that has nowhere to grow.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Servas,,It sounds like we need a project that is computationally heavy or uses the animal facility.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Sakura,,And something that doesn't need a glasshouse!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,And maybe a catalogue? Those seem to be the most reliable in the long run.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Takumi,,Just keep it away from the field and the broken spectroscopy suite.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Minako,,The animal facility is the only shared space with actual availability and accreditation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,Servas,,We are reaching a consensus on the constraints.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm excited to see the candidates!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope there is something stable.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Takumi,,As long as it's not a gamble on a flooded field.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Minako,,Let us see the proposals.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
