50,3,1,talk,Servas,,"We have a Microbiome Atlas, Protein Folding, Amphibian Regeneration, and Plant Drought Signaling.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Minako, Plant Drought Signaling uses greenhouses, right? That's a no-go if they are full!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,The Microbiome Atlas is a catalogue. Those are the ones that keep providing value.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Protein Folding likely needs that spectroscopy suite that's been idle. That's too risky.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Minako,,Correct. Plant Drought is out due to bookings. Protein Folding is out due to equipment failure.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Servas,,"That leaves the Atlas and the Amphibians. Amphibians need the animal facility, which Minako says is ready.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Sakura,,But the Atlas is a catalogue! Daisuke said those are the best.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes, but the Atlas needs field sites. Takumi said the field sites are being destroyed by fire and floods.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Takumi,,Exactly. The Atlas is a nightmare waiting to happen.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Minako,,The animal facility has vet cover and accreditation. Regeneration in Amphibians is the safest bet.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Servas,,Amphibians also avoid the phenotyping technician shortage if they use the resident vet.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I guess the Atlas is too risky if the sites are gone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I suppose the animal facility is a safer environment than the field.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm voting for the amphibians. No field sites, no broken spectroscopy.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Minako,,It is the only logical choice given the current infrastructure.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Servas,,I agree. Let us proceed to the vote.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm in!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Me too.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,talk,Takumi,,Let's do it.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
